sults demonstrate 99% precision on structured Indian documents.\nSubmission deadline for final dissertation evaluation is due tomorrow.','2026-11-25 07:00:01','2026-10-28 05:47:00','READY','IntelliFile: AI Powered On-Device Document Assistant Final Year Project Report\nDepartment of Computer Science and Engineering, Final Semester Project Documentation. Abstract: This project introduces a privacy-preserving document search and classification engine that runs locally on edge devices. Traditional file explorers only organize files by name and extension.','[\"Intellifile\",\"Final\",\"Project\"]','[\"IntelliFile: AI Powered On-Device Document Assistant Final Year Project Report\\nDepartment of Computer Science and Engineering, Final Semester Project Documentation.\",\"Abstract: This project introduces a privacy-preserving document search and classification engine that runs locally on edge devices.\",\"Traditional file explorers only organize files by name and extension.\",\"IntelliFile integrates TF-IDF vector embeddings and multinomial Naive Bayes models to automatically classify incoming scans into Marksheets, Identity cards, and Assignments.\",\"Methodology: The system implements an extractive question answering pipeline that calculates cosine similarity between user queries and candidate document sentences.\",\"Results demonstrate 99% precision on structured Indian documents.\",\"Submission deadline for final dissertation evaluation is due tomorrow.\"]','[\"No quantitative metrics, analytical findings, or statistical observations identified in this document.\"]','[\"No quantitative metrics, analytical findings, or statistical observations identified in this document.\"]','[\"AI — IntelliFile: AI Powered On-Device Document Assistant Final Year Project Report\\nDepartment of Computer Science and Engineering, Final Semeste\",\"TF — IntelliFile integrates TF-IDF vector embeddings and multinomial Naive Bayes models to automatically classify incoming scans into Marksheets,\",\"IDF — IntelliFile integrates TF-IDF vector embeddings and multinomial Naive Bayes models to automatically classify incoming scans into Marksheets,\",\"IntelliFile — AI Powered On-Device Document Assistant Final Year Project Report\",\"Abstract — This project introduces a privacy-preserving document search and classification engine that runs locally on edge devices\",\"Methodology — The system implements an extractive question answering pipeline that calculates cosine similarity between user queries a\"]','Results demonstrate 99% precision on structured Indian documents.',NULL,'2026-11-25 12:30:01'),(10,5,'Cloud Computing Lecture','PPTX','1.5 KB','uploads/documents/dd88b0657cf5d618ac1f5caf_cloud_lecture.pptx','Notes','Internal Storage','NORMAL',0,0,2,'Slide 1: Cloud Computing Lecture Notes Chapter 4 Virtualization, Containers, and Docker Architecture study guide\n\nSlide 2: Key Topics: Amazon Web Services EC2 instances, S3 object storage buckets, and Kubernetes cluster orchestration. Exam revision notes: Containerization isolates application runtimes without hypervisor overhead.','2026-11-25 07:00:01','2026-10-28 05:47:00','READY','Slide 1: Cloud Computing Lecture Notes Chapter 4 Virtualization, Containers, and Docker Architecture study guide Slide 2: Key Topics: Amazon Web Services EC2 instances, S3 object storage buckets, and Kubernetes cluster orchestration. Exam revision notes: Containerization isolates application runtimes without hypervisor overhead.','[\"Slide\"]','[\"Slide 1: Cloud Computing Lecture Notes Chapter 4 Virtualization, Containers, and Docker Architecture study guide\",\"Slide 2: Key Topics: Amazon Web Services EC2 instances, S3 object storage buckets, and Kubernetes cluster orchestration.\",\"Exam revision notes: Containerization isolates application runtimes without hypervisor overhead.\"]','[\"No quantitative metrics, analytical findings, or statistical observations identified in this document.\"]','[\"No quantitative metrics, analytical 