t\",\"YOU — GO TO EMERGENCY IMMEDIATELY IF YOU HAVE \\n• Sudden, very severe \\\"worst ever\\\" headache \\n• Weakness, numbness, or trouble speaking \\n• Fever wit\"]','This guide is for general education and does not replace a medical consultation.',NULL,'2026-11-25 12:30:01'),(41,18,'Run NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra FREE in Your Terminal.pdf','PDF','103.8 KB','uploads/documents/732ded1e349042ebaf18086e_RunNVIDIANemotron3UltraFREEinYourTerminal.pdf','General','Internal Storage',NULL,0,0,5,'','2026-11-25 07:00:01','2026-11-04 02:53:19','READY','Run NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra FREE in Your Terminal.pdf is a PDF document securely stored in IntelliSpace containing 0 characters.','[\"No distinct subtopics or section headings identified in this document.\"]','[\"The document contains minimal text without distinct key point statements.\"]','[\"No quantitative metrics, analytical findings, or statistical observations identified in this document.\"]','[\"No quantitative metrics, analytical findings, or statistical observations identified in this document.\"]','[\"No specialized technical terms or definitions detected in this document.\"]','In conclusion, Run NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra FREE in Your Terminal.pdf provides a complete PDF reference record structured across 1 core informational areas.',NULL,'2026-11-25 12:30:01'),(42,26,'log.txt','TXT','3.7 KB','uploads/documents/45156d3b00299144922873d4_log.txt','Project Report','Internal Storage',NULL,0,0,2,'Sat Oct 31 21:57:01 2026\nAlternative_Saves_Android_Port\nRen\'Py 8.1.1.23060707\n \n\nBootstrap to the start of init.init. took 0.00s\nBootstrap to the start of init.init. took 0.00s\n\nManufacturer vivo Model I2403\nAndroid Version: 16\nDevice Arch:  android-arm64_v8a\n\nScreen diagonal is 5.603372103083984 inches.\nVersion: Ren\'Py 8.1.1.23060707\nEarly init. took 0.16s\nEarly init. took 0.16s\nAttempting to sync your saves to/from stock ANDROID_PUBLIC location...\nAndroid search paths: /storage/emulated/0/Android/data/da.rtm/files