ments.\",\"Existing storage tools save files but do not understand them.\",\"AI-driven document intelligence offers an affordable, scalable, and time-saving solution, making this application highly relevant in the modern digital workplace.\",\"PROBLEM IT AIMS TO SOLVE:\\nInformation overload from too many documents: Users receive large numbers of files daily and cannot quickly identify which ones are urgent or important.\",\"Manual sorting and organization is time-consuming: Naming, tagging, and arranging files into folders takes significant effort and is often done inconsistently.\",\"No intelligent understanding of document content: Traditional storage tools treat all files equally and cannot identify urgency, importance, or required action.\"]','[\"INTELLIFILE — AI-BASED INTELLIGENT DOCUMENT PRIORITY SYSTEM\\nEXECUTIVE SUMMARY:\\nAPP OVERVIEW: IntelliFile is an intelligent document management application that uses AI to automatically read, classify, and prioritize documents so that users always know which file needs attention first.\",\"Users can upload or scan documents such as invoices, contracts, notices, certificates, reports, and assignments.\",\"Existing storage tools save files but do not understand them.\",\"AI-driven document intelligence offers an affordable, scalable, and time-saving solution, making this application highly relevant in the modern digital workplace.\",\"PROBLEM IT AIMS TO SOLVE:\\nInformation overload from too many documents: Users receive large numbers of files daily and cannot quickly identify which ones are urgent or important.\",\"Manual sorting and organization is time-consuming: Naming, tagging, and arranging files into folders takes significant effort and is often done inconsistently.\",\"No intelligent understanding of document content: Traditional storage tools treat all files equally and cannot identify urgency, importance, or required action.\"]','[\"AI — INTELLIFILE — AI-BASED INTELLIGENT DOCUMENT PRIORITY SYSTEM\\nEXECUTIVE SUMMARY:\\nAPP OVERVIEW: IntelliFile is an intelligent document manageme\",\"BASED — INTELLIFILE — AI-BASED INTELLIGENT DOCUMENT PRIORITY SYSTEM\\nEXECUTIVE SUMMARY:\\nAPP OVERVIEW: IntelliFile is an intelligent document manageme\",\"SYSTEM — INTELLIFILE — AI-BASED INTELLIGENT DOCUMENT PRIORITY SYSTEM\\nEXECUTIVE SUMMARY:\\nAPP OVERVIEW: IntelliFile is an intelligent document manageme\",\"APP — INTELLIFILE — AI-BASED INTELLIGENT DOCUMENT PRIORITY SYSTEM\\nEXECUTIVE SUMMARY:\\nAPP OVERVIEW: IntelliFile is an intelligent document manageme\",\"MARKET — MARKET RELEVANCE: Individuals and organizations now receive documents through email, messaging apps, cloud drives, and paper, creating infor\",\"IT — PROBLEM IT AIMS TO SOLVE:\\nInformation overload from too many documents: Users receive large numbers of files daily and cannot quickly identi\"]','CONCLUSION\nIntelliFile — AI-Based Intelligent Document Priority System is more than a basic document storage application — it functions as a smart digital assistant for document management.',NULL,'2026-11-25 12:30:01');
