ned Milk … 1 ₹27 ₹27 Mother Dairy Cow Milk 1L 1 ₹56 ₹56 Aashirvaad Shudh Chakki Atta … 1 ₹245 ₹245 Fortune Sunlite Reﬁned Sunﬂo… 1 ₹135 ₹135 Tata Salt Vacuum Evaporated 1… 1 ₹28 ₹28 Lay\'s India\'s Magic Masala Pot… 3 ₹20 ₹60 Total Items: 6   Units: 8 GRAND TOTAL ₹551 Thank you for shopping with us!\"]','[\"TAX — Daksh Supermarket TAX INVOICE \\/ RETAIL RECEIPT Bill No: APP-20261124-090005-LGFT Date: 2026-11-24 09:00:06 ITEM QTY RATE TOTAL Amul Taaza Fr\",\"RETAIL — Daksh Supermarket TAX INVOICE \\/ RETAIL RECEIPT Bill No: APP-20261124-090005-LGFT Date: 2026-11-24 09:00:06 ITEM QTY RATE TOTAL Amul Taaza Fr\",\"APP — Daksh Supermarket TAX INVOICE \\/ RETAIL RECEIPT Bill No: APP-20261124-090005-LGFT Date: 2026-11-24 09:00:06 ITEM QTY RATE TOTAL Amul Taaza Fr\",\"LGFT — Daksh Supermarket TAX INVOICE \\/ RETAIL RECEIPT Bill No: APP-20261124-090005-LGFT Date: 2026-11-24 09:00:06 ITEM QTY RATE TOTAL Amul Taaza Fr\",\"ITEM — Daksh Supermarket TAX INVOICE \\/ RETAIL RECEIPT Bill No: APP-20261124-090005-LGFT Date: 2026-11-24 09:00:06 ITEM QTY RATE TOTAL Amul Taaza Fr\",\"QTY — Daksh Supermarket TAX INVOICE \\/ RETAIL RECEIPT Bill No: APP-20261124-090005-LGFT Date: 2026-11-24 09:00:06 ITEM QTY RATE TOTAL Amul Taaza Fr\"]','In conclusion, bill_APP-20261124-090005-LGFT.pdf provides a comprehensive overview of its subject matter across PDF format, organized into 2 core functional areas.',NULL,'2026-11-26 10:34:18'),(69,18,'IntelliFile_AI_Presentation_R.kishore.pptx','PPTX','3.6 MB','uploads/documents/6e638498a5c35b203481a1cd_IntelliFile_AI_Presentation_R.kishore.pptx','Document','/storage/emulated/0/Android/media/com.whatsapp/WhatsApp/Media/WhatsApp Documents/IntelliFile_AI_Pres','IMPORTANT',0,0,26,'Slide 1\n• INTELLIFILE AI\n• Find. Prioritize. Access.\n• IntelliFile is an AI-powered mobile document\n• application\n• BY\n• Name : R. KISHORE\n• Reg no : 252524002\n• Department :BSC.AIDS\n\nSlide 2\n• PRODUCT PROBLEM\n• Phones hold hundreds of documents, but most file managers only list them by name and date. Finding the right file on time is slow, and important files get buried.\n• Slow Search: Users must remember exact file names or scroll through long lists.\n• No Prioritization: Urgent and low-value files look the same.\n• Scattered Files: Downloads, WhatsApp and browser files end up in different places.\n• Missed Deadlines: Nothing reminds users about time-sensitive documents.\n• Solution\n• AI Smart Search: Find files with natural-language questions.\n• AI Prioritization: Mark documents Important, Normal or Low.\n• AI Vault: Index selected documents for AI analysis and insights.\n• Privacy by Design: Only documents are accessed, and only with consent.\n\nSlide 3\n• Project Overview\n• THE PROBLEM\n• SOLUTION\n• Files are spread across Downloads, WhatsApp and browser folders, so search by name often fails.\n• Important documents (IDs, policies, assignments) get lost among 100+ other files.\n• Users worry about privacy when apps read photos, media and personal data.\n• IntelliFile finds files using natural language, e.g. “find Kishore ppt”.\n• Files are grouped by priority with a dashboard, saved list and filters.\n• The AI Vault indexes chosen documents and shows AI Insights.\n• Alerts for new downloads, with quiet hours, keep users updated.\n\nSlide 4\n• Product domain study\n• SUMMARY:\n• IntelliFile AI is an AI-powered document management app for Android. It scans documents on the device (PDF, DOC, PPT, XLSX, CSV and more), shows them in one organised place, and lets users search with plain language. Each document can be marked Important, Normal or Low, saved for quick access, or moved to the AI Vault where it is indexed for AI analysis. Unlike ordinary file managers, IntelliFile focuses on finding the right document quickly and on keeping urgent files visible, while only accessing documents and never photos or media without consent.\n• ARTICLE:\n• Digital documents pile up fast on a student’s or professional’s phone. IntelliFile AI turns that pile into an organised, searchable library. Its AI assistant answers requests like “find my Kishore files” across Device Files and the AI Vault, while a priority dashboard shows how many documents are Important, Normal or Low.\n• CONCLUSION:\n• IntelliFile AI brings search, prioritization and privacy together in one simple app. By helping users find, prioritize and access files easily, it saves time and reduces the stress of lost or forgotten documents\n\nSlide 5\n• Problem Statement\n• Existing file managers list documents only by name and date, so finding the right file in 100+ documents takes too long.\n• Users cannot easily tell which documents are urgent, which are routine, and which can be ignored.\n• Documents downloaded from browsers and WhatsApp are scattered, and users are not alerted when new files arrive.\n• Many apps ask for broad access to photos and media, which raises privacy concerns.\n• There is a clear need for a lightweight, AI-powered Android app that finds, prioritizes and opens documents quickly and respects privacy.\n\nSlide 6\n• Project Scope\n• MY ROLE\n• MY RESPONSIBILITIES\n• The goal is to design and build a mobile app that helps users find, prioritize and access their documents easily. It works through AI natural-language search, priority tagging, an AI Vault for indexed documents, and simple, secure file permissions.\n• Designing the app interface and navigation.\n• Building file listing, search and priority modules.\n• Developing the AI chat and AI Vault features.\n• Adding notifications, themes and profile settings.\n• Testing the app with users for smooth performance.\n• Collecting feedback and improving the design.\n\nSlide 7\n• Project Plan\n• Phase\n• Wk 1\n• Wk 2\n• Wk 3\n• Wk 4\n• Wk 5\n• Wk 6\n• Concept Development & Research\n• UI/UX Design & Prototyping\n• Frontend Development\n• AI & File Module Integration\n• Usability Testing\n• Launch & Feedback\n• 28 Sep\n• 5 Oct\n• 12 Oct\n• 19 Oct\n• 19 Oct\n• 26 Oct\n• 26 Oct\n• 2 Nov\n\nSlide 8\n• USER 1\n• TA\n• Name: Tamil azahagan\n• Age: 21\n• Occupation: MCA Student\n• Location: Chennai\n• GOAL :\n• Tamil azahagan wants to open the right assignment or presentation within seconds, and to keep urgent files at the top.\n• FRUSTRATION :\n• His phone holds 150+ PDFs, slides and notes from many classes.\n• Before a viva she spends 10+ minutes scrolling for one document.\n• Important files look the same as old, unused ones.\n• PROBLEM STATEMENT :\n• Students need a way to search documents quickly and see which files matter most. IntelliFile helps through natural-language search, priority tags (Important / Normal / Low) and a Saved list for quick access.\n\nSlide 9\n• USER 2\n• VI\n• Name: vinnoli\n• Age: 26\n• Occupation: Software Engineer\n• Location: Chennai\n• GOAL :\n• vinnoli wants to find any work document by describing it, and to be notified when new files are downloaded, without giving up privacy.\n• FRUSTRATION :\n• Documents arrive from email, browser and WhatsApp into different folders.\n• He often misses deadlines because urgent files are hidden.\n• He avoids apps that need access to his photos and media.\n• PROBLEM STATEMENT :\n• Working professionals need one place to see all documents, spot urgent ones and get alerts about new downloads. IntelliFile offers document-only access, new-document alerts, quiet hours and an AI Vault with insights.\n\nSlide 10\n• User Journey Map\n• Persona : Tamilazahagan, 21, Student   |   Goal: To quickly find, prioritize and open documents on her phone.\n\nSlide 11\n• Competitive analysis\n\nSlide 12\n• Business Potential\n• IntelliFile AI targets anyone who handles many digital documents. Students (40%) and working professionals (30%) form the largest group, followed by small business owners (20%) and researchers or others (10%).\n• These users need fast, reliable file access every day, which gives the app strong adoption potential. With AI search, priority tagging and a privacy-first approach, it can stand out from ordinary file managers.\n• (Audience split shown is an estimate for presentation.)\n\nSlide 13\n• User Pain Points\n• Time Wasted Searching: Scrolling through long file lists just to find one document wastes time, especially before exams, meetings and deadlines.\n• No Sense of Priority: Urgent and unimportant files are mixed together, so users cannot tell what to open first and may miss deadlines.\n• Scattered Downloads: Files from browsers and WhatsApp land in different folders, and users are not told when something new arrives.\n• Privacy Worries: Many apps request access to photos and media. Users want an app that touches documents only.\n\nSlide 14\n• Flow Diagram\n• Login / Sign Up\n• Home\n• Grant Document Access\n• Files\n• Device Files\n• IntelliSpace\n• Priority Dashboard\n• AI\n• Ask / Voice Search\n• Open Result\n• Chat History\n• Saved\n• Saved Files\n• Priority Filter\n• Open / Share\n• Profile\n• Edit Profile\n• Theme · Notifications\n• Help & Support\n\nSlide 15\n• App Screens: Files\n• Priority Dashboard\n• AI Document Vault\n• Recent Files: Other\n• Recent Files: PPT\n\nSlide 16\n• App Screens: AI & Saved\n• IntelliFile AI Home\n• AI File Search Results\n• AI Chat History\n• Saved Files by Priority\n\nSlide 17\n• App Screens: Profile & Settings\n• Edit Profile\n• Profile Picture Options\n• Notifications\n• Theme\n\nSlide 18\n• App Screens: Permissions & Support\n• File Permissions\n• About IntelliFile\n• Help & Support\n• Contact Support\n\nSlide 19\n• Usability Studies\n• Round 1: Initial Study\n• Participants: 5–7 users (students and working professionals)\n• Search Issues: Some queries returned no match when file names were spelled differently.\n• Low Clarity: Priority labels were not obvious at first.\n• Navigation: Users wanted faster access to Saved files.\n• Improvement: Add bottom tab bar and filter chips.\n• Round 2: Refined Study\n• Participants: 5–7 new users\n• Improved Navigation: The bottom bar made switching tabs quick.\n• Clear Priorities: Colour-coded tags helped users spot urgent files.\n• Trust: The privacy note on File Permissions increased confidence.\n• Final Recommendation: Add onboarding and smarter suggestions.\n\nSlide 20\n• List of Components\n\nSlide 21\n• Project learning\n• Project Impact\n• What I Learnt\n• IntelliFile AI makes it faster and less stressful to manage documents on a phone. AI search, priority tags and an AI Vault turn a long list of files into a clear, usable library, while the document-only permission model keeps personal data private. It can help students and professionals save time and avoid missing important files.\n• Technological Innovation: Integrating AI search, file indexing and mobile UI into one app.\n• Problem-Solving Skills: Handling permissions, large file lists, and priority logic.\n• Impact of Technology: Seeing how AI and privacy-first design can improve everyday productivity.\n\nSlide 22\n• Product Design Patent\n• PATENT\n• Claim 1: A document management system that assigns Important, Normal or Low priority to files and displays priority counts in a dashboard and a filtered Saved list.\n• Claim 2: An AI assistant that accepts typed or spoken natural-language queries and returns matching files from both device storage and an AI Vault.\n• Claim 3: A privacy-first access model that reads only documents, indexes user-selected files into an AI Vault, and sends new-document alerts with automatic quiet hours.\n\nSlide 23\n• Next Steps\n• Step A: Design Refinement\n• Refine UI using usability feedback.\n• Improve AI search for vague queries.\n• Add onboarding walkthrough and more languages.\n• Step B: Prototyping and Testing\n• Build a high-fidelity prototype with full AI integration.\n• Test on different Android devices.\n• Run beta testing with real users.\n• Step C: Documentation and Filing\n• Prepare technical documentation for patent filing.\n• Create user manual and onboarding guide.\n• Finalise privacy policy and terms of service.\n\nSlide 24\n• Step D: Compliance and Approvals\n• Google Play Approvals\n• Follow Google Play policies for storage and file access permissions.\n• Use Material Design guidelines for consistent UI/UX.\n• Test on multiple Android versions and screen sizes.\n• Publish clear privacy policy and terms before submission.\n• Prepare app name, screenshots, description and category.\n• Privacy, Quality and Security\n• Data Privacy: Handle documents securely and follow applicable privacy laws.\n• Access Control: Keep to document-only access with explicit consent.\n• Security Testing: Third-party testing of AI Vault and storage handling.\n• Reliability: Regular updates to meet store policies.\n\nSlide 25\n• THANK YOU\n• E-mail: kishoreraja437@gmail.com\n• Name:R. Kishore\n• Reg No: 252524002\n\nSlide 26','2026-11-26 07:47:54','2026-11-26 07:47:54','READY','• IntelliFile is an AI-powered mobile document • application • BY • Name : R. • AI Vault: Index selected documents for AI analysis and insights. Slide 3 • Project Overview • THE PROBLEM • SOLUTION • Files are spread across Downloads, WhatsApp and browser folders, so search by name often fails.','[\"INTELLIFILE AI\",\"PRODUCT PROBLEM\",\"Project Overview\",\"Product domain study\",\"Problem Statement\",\"Project Scope\"]','[\"Finding the right file on time is slow, and important files get buried.\",\"• AI Prioritization: Mark documents Important, Normal or Low.\",\"• Important documents (IDs, policies, assignments) get lost among 100+ other files.\",\"Each document can be marked Important, Normal or Low, saved for quick access, or moved to the AI Vault where it is indexed for AI analysis.\",\"Unlike ordinary file managers, IntelliFile focuses on finding the right document quickly and on keeping urgent files visible, while only accessing documents and never photos or media without consent.\",\"Slide 22 • Product Design Patent • PATENT • Claim 1: A document management system that assigns Important, Normal or Low priority to files and displays priority counts in a dashboard and a filtered Saved list.\",\"• Claim 3: A privacy-first access model that reads only documents, indexes user-selected files into an AI Vault, and sends new-document alerts with automatic quiet hours.\"]','[\"KISHORE • Reg no : 252524002 • Department :BSC.AIDS Slide 2 • PRODUCT PROBLEM • Phones hold hundreds of documents, but most file managers only list them by name and date.\",\"• Slow Search: Users must remember exact file names or scroll through long lists.\",\"• Missed Deadlines: Nothing reminds users about time-sensitive documents.\",\"Slide 3 • Project Overview • THE PROBLEM • SOLUTION • Files are spread across Downloads, WhatsApp and browser folders, so search by name often fails.\",\"• Users worry about privacy when apps read photos, media and personal data.\",\"• Files are grouped by priority with a dashboard, saved list and filters.\",\"• Alerts for new downloads, with quiet hours, keep users updated.\"]','[\"KISHORE • Reg no : 252524002 • Department :BSC.AIDS Slide 2 • PRODUCT PROBLEM • Phones hold hundreds of documents, but most file managers only list them by name and date.\",\"• Slow Search: Users must remember exact file names or scroll through long lists.\",\"• Missed Deadlines: Nothing reminds users about time-sensitive documents.\",\"Slide 3 • Project Overview • THE PROBLEM • SOLUTION • Files are spread across Downloads, WhatsApp and browser folders, so search by name often fails.\",\"• Users worry about privacy when apps read photos, media and personal data.\",\"• Files are grouped by priority with a dashboard, saved list and filters.\",\"• Alerts for new downloads, with quiet hours, keep users updated.\"]','[\"AI — Slide 1 • INTELLIFILE AI • Find.\",\"BY — • IntelliFile is an AI-powered mobile document • application • BY • Name : R.\",\"BSC — KISHORE • Reg no : 252524002 • Department :BSC.AIDS Slide 2 • PRODUCT PROBLEM • Phones hold hundreds of documents, but most file managers on\",\"AIDS — KISHORE • Reg no : 252524002 • Department :BSC.AIDS Slide 2 • PRODUCT PROBLEM • Phones hold hundreds of documents, but most file managers on\",\"XLSX — It scans documents on the device (PDF, DOC, PPT, XLSX, CSV and more), shows them in one organised place, and lets users search with plain la\",\"MY — Slide 6 • Project Scope • MY ROLE • MY RESPONSIBILITIES • The goal is to design and build a mobile app that helps users find, prioritize and\"]','Kishore • Reg No: 252524002 Slide 26',NULL,'2026-11-26 13:17:54'),(70,18,'TWO_WHEELER_Phonepe_COI2610192023534939454752.PDF','PDF','447.6 KB','uploads/documents/614809f691d721f542cd943d_TWO_WHEELER_Phonepe_COI2610192023534939454752.PDF','Document','/storage/emulated/0/Android/media/com.whatsapp/WhatsApp/Media/WhatsApp Documents/TWO_WHEELER_Phonepe','IMPORTANT',0,0,4,'Reference No.: W605519967 Date: Oct 19, 2026 TAMILAZHAGAN R TIRUVANNAMALAI, 632301, ARNI, TIRUVANNAMALAI, TAMIL NADU TIRUVANNAMALAI TAMIL NADU 632301 Mobile No: 97******12 Sub: Risk Assumption Letter Dear TAMILAZHAGAN R, We value your relationship with ICICI Lombard General Insurance Company Limited and thank you for choosing us as your preferred insurance provider. Please find enclosed Policy No. 3005/459113804/00/B00 , The same has been issued based on below mentioned details, provided by you at the time of policy purchase. Insured & Vehicle Details Name of the Insured Period of Insurance Vehicle Make / Model RTO City Vehicle Registration No. Vehicle Registration Date Engine No. Chassis No. Current Year NCB\\(%\\) TAMILAZHAGAN R Oct 22, 2026 to Oct 21, 2027 HONDA MOTORCYCLE / ACTIVA STD TAMILNADU-CHENNAI TN02BM5167 Aug 03, 2018 50899 50833 50% Previous Policy Details Previous Policy No. Previous Policy Period Previous Year NCB\\(%\\) Claims Made Under Previous Policy Previous Insurer Name Previous Policy Type 3005/403254484/00/B00 08-08-2025 to 07-08-2026 50% 0 ICLB Comprehensive Package 1 0 The commencement of coverage of risk under the policy is subject